                                                "sense_id": "c2a48564-18b0-3017-8f6a-3b2a36a856f2",
                                                "text": "However, even with money and caregivers, the child is left without a parent and most likely without a plan for their emotional, psychological, and spiritual well-being. A time will come when you will no longer be able to parent your child, period."
                                            }
